Z||000016||MinnGreenGT||11-15-2001||09:52 AM||||<B>Sweet</B> install... I've been planning something like that for awhile- just don't have the funds for it yet.  The DVD is awsome, I'd never even thought of installing it there.  Curious as to what kind of DVD player that is (most portables that I've found look more like a discman)? And do you have any "working" pics of the DVD install?<P>DTS 5.1 would be fairly easy to install- you just need a reciever that is 5.1 compatible (check with your local AudioKing, etc... they've got 'em- and the Volvo C70 came stock with a 5.1 DTS setup).<P>------------------<BR>              <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GreenGT6.gif"> ||||reg||1
